  · exact higham11_7_tridiagonalOneByOneLiftTrailingPerturbation_bound
      n E β hEbound
  · exact higham11_7_tridiagonalOneByOneLiftTrailingPerturbation_leadingBlockSupport
      n offset E hEsupp
  · intro i j
