source-constant cap `‖T‖∞ ≤ ‖T_hat‖∞`. -/
theorem higham11_8_aasen_factor_solve_norm_budget_of_relative_T_hat_error
    (fp : FPModel) (n : ℕ)
    (L T L_hat T_hat L_T_hat U_T_hat : Fin n → Fin n → ℝ)
